<p>The final HTTP response sets <code>completed: true</code>. The terminal step is therefore the last active cursor; an API client should not submit another customer message to that session.</p>

<h2 id="what-to-compare-when-your-replay-differs">What to compare when your replay differs</h2>

<table>
