  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Turns 1–13</td><td>Only current-stage facts are collected; no premium is invented.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Turn 15</td><td>The review says the corrected roof is four years old.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Turn 16</td><td>All three initial options, disclosure, and quote ID are code-rendered.</td></tr>
